# Rule to prevent changes to Solidity contract files

## Description
This rule prevents any modifications to Solidity contract files (*.sol) in the project. This ensures that the smart contract code remains stable and prevents accidental changes that could affect the blockchain functionality.

## File Pattern
*.sol

## Action
BLOCK

## Message
Changes to Solidity contract files are not allowed. Please maintain the existing contract implementations.

## Exceptions
- No exceptions allowed. All Solidity files are protected from modifications.
